<title>RUSSIA: St Petersburg to auction 140 bln rbls munis June 4.</title>
<headline>St Petersburg to auction 140 bln rbls munis June 4.</headline>
<dateline>ST PETERSBURG, Russia 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The City of St Petersburg will auction 140 billion roubles of 420-day GGKO municipal bonds on June 4, the city's Finance Committee said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Full details of the auction follow:</p>
<p>    Series number			     SU35007GSPMO</p>
<p>    Issue volume				140 bln rbls</p>
<p>    Denominations			     100,000 rbls</p>
<p>    Issue date				  June 4, 1997</p>
<p>    Tenor					 420 days</p>
<p>    Maturity date			     July 29, 1998</p>
<p>--St Petersburg Newsroom, +7812 219 9209</p>
</text>
